    <string name="set_sync_book_files">Sync book files</string>
    <string name="set_sync_book_files_sum">Off by default. Enable on each device. Files are not encrypted by Yomu and need storage and data. Books deleted locally after a successful sync stay removed here; other devices and remote files are not deleted. Restoring a backup resets this protection. WebDAV requires strong ETags and conditional writes. Shared folders require a provider that supports renaming; sync devices one at a time. Image folders imported while file sync is on are experimental. Previously imported folders need migration, which is not yet available; they stop file sync.</string>
